  "einstKiHinweis": "As in digiKam, every AI feature runs offline on this machine. The model files are not bundled with the app but downloaded on demand from official open-source sources – once, after which everything works offline.",
  "einstAutoAnalyseTitel": "Run AI analysis automatically after importing",
  "einstAutoAnalyseText": "Importing only files the photos away, which keeps it fast. Faces, text recognition, image search and descriptions follow in the background. Switched off, you can start them by hand under Tools at any time.",
